        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "id": "step-6",
      "heading": "Serve",
      "blocks": [
        "Crumble Greek style salad cheese over the naan pizzas and drizzle with {{honey}} honey. Serve with sliced apple and baby leaves, drizzled with balsamic glaze."
